// v3320 -- BAND STRUCTURE, AND THE FORBIDDEN GAP AS A FALSIFIER. The last of the three devices scoped in v3318.
//
// An electron in a periodic potential cannot have just any energy, and the Kronig-Penney relation says which
// exactly: an energy is allowed when |RHS| <= 1, with no approximation anywhere in the statement. So every band
// edge is an EXACT ROOT of |RHS| = 1 -- 2.04005, 3.56071, 8.43126, 14.22566, 19.81360, 31.94512 -- found by
// bisection and never shown to the solver.
//
// *** AND THE TWO ENERGIES WITH A CLOSED FORM ARE EXACTLY THE TWO A REAL EIGENSOLVER CAN REACH. *** cos(kL) = +1
// at k = 0 and -1 at k = pi/L, which is also precisely where the Bloch Hamiltonian stops being complex:
// periodic at one, ANTIperiodic at the other. The band edges are the reachable states. That feels like a
// coincidence and is not one -- it is the same symmetry from both sides.
//
// MEASURED: edges to 1.8e-3 at n=800, halving with the grid (first order, because the barrier step lands
// mid-cell rather than on a node), and the P, A, A, P, P, A, A alternation of edges between k = 0 and k = pi/L
// reproduced exactly. That alternation is a STRUCTURAL claim with no tolerance in it, and a wrap sign that was
// wrong would break it immediately while still producing plausible energies.
//
// *** THE NAIVE FALSIFIER FAILS ON CORRECT PHYSICS, AND THAT IS THE FINDING WORTH KEEPING. *** "No state may lie
// in a forbidden gap" is the sharpest claim available -- a region the theory declares EMPTY rather than an
// agreement within a tolerance. But a numeric edge sits slightly BELOW its exact partner (8.41407 against
// 8.43126) and therefore lands inside the exact gap by 0.017, so an edge-to-edge test calls a correctly
// converging solver wrong. The gap INTERIOR -- the middle 80%, far outside the discretisation error and still
// 15.40 of forbidden energy across three gaps -- is the honest region to police.
//
// SABOTAGE: the wrap sign is the whole of Bloch's theorem at these two points. Using +1 for both reports half
// the band edges twice and misses the others entirely, 6.9e-1 off.
//
// The eigensolver is IMPORTED from physics/quantum/rmt.js for the third time this session (RMT, the beam, and
// now this). One symmetric eigensolver in this tree.
//
// Registry 51 -> 52 instruments. Knowledge index 681 -> 682. All three devices scoped in v3318 are now built:
// reaction-diffusion, elasticity, band structure.
