// v3409 -- THE HALL EFFECT, WHERE THE FALSIFIER IS A QUANTITY THAT MUST NOT CHANGE.
//
// Put a current through a conductor and a field across it, and a voltage appears at right angles. The exact
// answer is rho_xy = B/(nq) -- no mass, no scattering time, no temperature -- which is why a Hall measurement
// gives carrier density directly and why the SIGN of the result was inexplicable until band theory explained
// holes. Measured to 1.4% worst across a tenfold field range, linear to 1.0%, with wc*tau reaching 5.28.
//
// *** BUT THE KEY THAT CATCHES THE REAL MISTAKE IS THE ONE WHERE NOTHING HAPPENS. *** The transverse
// CONDUCTIVITY collapses with field -- measured, sigma_xx/sigma_0 falls 0.9948 to 0.0343, a factor of 29 -- and
// across that same collapse the RESISTIVITY rho_xx MOVES BY UNDER 2%. There is no magnetoresistance in the
// single-carrier Drude model. The two facts are not in tension: rho is the INVERSE OF THE TENSOR, not the
// reciprocal of its diagonal, and inverting a 2x2 with off-diagonal terms restores the (1 + (wc tau)^2) exactly.
// The closed form gives 3.548691e-5 at both B=0 and B=3, identical to twelve digits.
//
// SABOTAGE: write rho_xx = 1/sigma_xx, which is what the notation invites, and it reports a 2796%
// MAGNETORESISTANCE THAT DOES NOT EXIST -- and it grows monotonically with field, so it looks like physics
// rather than like an error. That is the whole reason this device is graded on a quantity that must stay still.
//
// The transport is Monte Carlo: carriers under the Lorentz force with Poisson scattering, drift from the
// ensemble, and nothing in the integrator knows sigma_0 or the closed form. The magnetic step is a Boris
// rotation preserving speed to 1e-15, because a plain Euler step gains 6.2e-4 per step under a pure B field --
// which would appear as exactly the magnetoresistance this device exists to say is absent, and would be
// indistinguishable from it.
//
// AND rho_xy CONTAINS NO tau AND NO MASS, verified by measurement rather than by reading the formula: tripling
// the scattering time leaves it at -1.2544e-4 against -1.2503e-4 while tripling rho_xx exactly. Flipping the
// carrier sign flips rho_xy and leaves rho_xx alone.
//
// ---- AND A QUESTION THAT FOUND A GAP: DO WE HAVE BEER-LAMBERT? ----
// HALF, AND UNNAMED. radon() computes the line integral of mu, which IS the Beer-Lambert exponent and is CT's
// entire premise. But nothing in this tree ever takes the exponential, measures I/I0, or exercises the
// NONLINEARITY -- and the law's failure mode, beam hardening under a polychromatic beam, is the dominant
// artefact in real CT. The law is assumed everywhere and tested nowhere. Logged as the one OPEN item in
// tools/ship/nextRounds.mjs, which had none before this.
//
// Registry 66 -> 67. Electromagnetism 2 -> 4 instruments this session (fdtd, maxwell, waveguide, hall).
// Knowledge index -> 750 gates.
