// v3428 -- MICROLENSING AND FRIEDMANN, AND A PATTERN THAT IS NO LONGER AN ANECDOTE.
//
// A -- MICROLENSING: AN INVARIANT THAT SEES NOTHING. A point lens makes two images whose magnification
//   DIFFERENCE is exactly 1 -- for every alignment, mass and distance, carrying no parameter at all. So it is
//   BLIND to an error in the Einstein radius, and that was the reason to build it. Measured: theta_E wrong by
//   0.5x, 2x and 10x leaves mu_+ - mu_- at 1.000000000000000 while the TOTAL magnification moves 2.6476 to
//   1.5320, 5.0747 and 25.0150.
//
//   *** WHICH MAKES THREE INDEPENDENT INSTANCES OF THE SAME SHAPE, IN THREE SUBJECTS. ***
//     v3426 oscillation -- unitarity is exact and cannot see a 27% error in the phase constant.
//     v3428 lensing     -- mu_+ - mu_- = 1 exactly and cannot see a tenfold error in theta_E.
//     v3428 friedmann   -- Om + Or + Ok + OL = 1 exactly and cannot see ANYTHING, because Ok is DEFINED as the
//                          remainder. An absurd universe with Om = 99 and OL = -400 still closes exactly.
//   One instance is an anecdote. Three in three subjects is a property of how keys work: A TRUE,
//   EXACTLY-SATISFIED IDENTITY IS WORTH CHECKING AND IS NEVER SUFFICIENT.
//
//   Other exact values fell out unprompted: a source on the Einstein ring is magnified by exactly 3/sqrt(5), and
//   at u = 1 the images sit at the GOLDEN RATIO and its negative reciprocal, with y+ * y- = -1 for every u.
//   theta_E scales as sqrt(M) to 1e-12 -- a scaling law being a stronger check than any single value, since it
//   cannot be satisfied by a lucky constant. And the singularity is returned HONESTLY: perfect alignment gives
//   Infinity, rising as exactly 1/u, because the divergence is the point-source idealisation failing rather than
//   the physics. Clamping it would turn a known limitation into an invented measurement.
//   A units slip was caught in the printing rather than the physics: the first readout of theta_E was labelled
//   micro-arcsec and is milli.
//
// B -- FRIEDMANN: ONE INTEGRATOR, THREE EXACT REGIMES THAT FAIL DIFFERENTLY. Matter-only is exactly 2/3 of a
//   Hubble time with a ~ t^(2/3) (exponent fitted in log-log from the integrated track, not read off the
//   formula); radiation-only exactly 1/2 with t^(1/2); Lambda-only exponential at d(ln a)/d(H0 t) = 1.000000000,
//   a DIFFERENT FUNCTIONAL FORM so an error in the power-law branch cannot hide there. Same structure as the
//   beam's static/vibration/buckling, and the same reason all three are worth having.
//
//   THE AGE IS THE KEY THAT IS NOT BLIND: matter diluting as a^-2 instead of a^-3 -- a plausible typo that the
//   closure identity waves straight through -- gives 0.999999 against 0.666667. And a flat universe with
//   Om = 0.315, OL = 0.685 at H0 = 67.4 comes out 13.796 Gyr against the Planck 13.797, INTEGRATED from the
//   Friedmann equation rather than looked up. The Hubble time is 14.507 Gyr, which is NOT the age; the near
//   agreement is a coincidence of our epoch rather than an identity, and is routinely confused for one.
//
