// — those float in the sky relative to natural terrain (which caps at ~y=10)
// and look like "old stuff" that won't go away. They aren't in localStorage,
// they reload from disk on every page boot. Reset now opts you out for one
// boot (skipSceneOnce, one-shot); hardReset opts you out permanently
// (disableScene). Console: window.disableSceneJson()/enableSceneJson().
const _SKIP_ONCE_KEY  = "voxelengine.skipSceneOnce";
