        id: "architecture",
        label: "ARCHITECTURE \u2014 system diagram",
        setPos: 4,
        hint: "Full-screen view of the whole multi-runtime system: VBA simulation \u2192 WebGL engine \u2192 Node bridge \u2192 PowerShell/Python listener \u2192 Home Assistant, plus external services. Static reference view; clicks pass through so you can still cycle demos.",
        // v1127 — flip card. Front = architecture.svg. Rotate it (the ⟲ button) and
        // the back reveals the LIVE engine render behind (the back face is transparent),
        // or tap "Gemini voxel" to grab a generated voxel object onto the back. Rotate
