// Round 92 — Ollama heartbeat avatar. Small mascot anchored above the
// Pip window that reflects the LLM pipeline's activity in real time:
//   idle    — Ollama present and quiet (curled cat, Zzz)
//   active  — request in flight (alert posture + spinning gear)
//   result  — request completed (jumps with "!" bark bubble), auto
//             returns to idle after 1.2s
