// v1645 — auto-show the avatar EXCEPT on the docked sandbox boot (the default), where the docked SVG stage and its
// little robot lead and the full avatar is one click away (the dock's blue underbar). This removes the boot flash
// where the panel appeared for ~1s before the dock hid it. A real demo boot (autostart set) still shows the avatar.
