          hint.innerHTML = 'Master switch for running programs. While <b>off</b>, nothing can be started/stopped/restarted (you can still edit the list). Set an optional <b>PIN</b> to require it for every start/stop/restart and for editing the list (it\\u2019s sent automatically from this device and on voice/Twitch commands).';
